{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03356","headline":"入泷州江 · 宋之问","name":"入泷州江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤舟泛盈盈，江流日纵横。\n夜杂蛟螭寝，晨披瘴疠行。\n潭蒸水沫起，山热火云生。\n猿躩时能啸，鸢飞莫敢鸣。\n海穷南徼尽，乡远北魂惊。\n泣向文身国，悲看凿齿氓。\n地偏多育蛊，风恶好相鲸。\n余本岩栖客，悠哉慕玉京。\n厚恩尝愿答，薄宦不祈成。\n违隐乖求志，披荒爲近名。\n镜愁玄发改，心负紫芝荣。\n运啓中兴历，时逢外域清。\n祗应保忠信，延促付神明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}